{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|006ED69E4E9F21EFA59B6E8B765799D4", "source_en": "Gajov make good armor.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يصنع درع جيد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|01E276244CF8F690EDA0359023ADC0AD", "source_en": "Here. Fine Karsivite dragon forged weapon. Reminds Gajov of home.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "خذ. سلاح من تنين كارسيفيتي مصاغ. يذكر قاجوف بالوطن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|03A94DDA4AA897EEF974FEBE61639C1C", "source_en": "Spiky toy.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لعبة شائكة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|03E6E7A84371A6ED75D5DD83ADF54BB2", "source_en": "'kay.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "طيب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|045A328D4782A92C2275C2AA487969B2", "source_en": "You bring Gajov material?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أنت تجلب لقاجوف مواد؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|067CA99A4BE851BB1F9EA397B80B6E9D", "source_en": "They call me animal. But Gajov no animal. Not like them.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "يسمونني حيوان. لكن قاجوف ليس حيوان. ليس مثلهم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|07F9C06D4FB3E47C25A3CBBED720889B", "source_en": "Special fire.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "نار خاصة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|08AB5D9E44DD4B5D417ABD9439EB9290", "source_en": "But Gajov know the power of steel.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لكن قاجوف يعرف قوة الفولاذ.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|097E106B4E857045C799B7BBB76C40EA", "source_en": "(grunt)", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "(زمجرة)", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|09ABDF164CBD8F1FA8E09C86813CB319", "source_en": "Go now.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اذهب الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|09ED11A7499019C6368C2B9503744D4D", "source_en": "No.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|0A6F35214B8F1329BD17F9BDE8B1278D", "source_en": "Bring Gajov material, Gajov forge.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أحضر مواد لقاجوف، قاجوف يصهر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|0B639CA1493DAF8812B26D8403076305", "source_en": "Trust Gajov's skill.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ثق بمهارة قاجوف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|0BE6CCEF46AD2933E1A9B4998DBA6C1D", "source_en": "Finally Gajov can start.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يبدأ أخيراً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|0D40D3E6437F5F651E01CFA9B26F9E47", "source_en": "Another broken hammer...", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "مطرقة مكسورة أخرى...", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|0DF3EC4B4B28E4685A54D5A23B69E481", "source_en": "Choose sword. Sword good.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اختر سيفاً. السيف جيد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|0DFE186B45085C5304041D8D3E217747", "source_en": "Now go.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "اذهب الآن.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|0F5E3C28448CC53210067FA0F0025408", "source_en": "Good pup.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "جرو جيد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|11B4013C483D2F250311E1A66328A7BE", "source_en": "Now, kill gods.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "الآن، قتل آلهة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|11CDDCF340E47AA220B72C95AE7DDD83", "source_en": "What pup want?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ماذا يريد الجرو؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|14A712E348E56DB86A7D1BBDC65FEC88", "source_en": "As promised a mighty weapon. ", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "كما وعد قاجوف، سلاح عظيم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|173C49444A83E7ED095B5D8993A18634", "source_en": "No! Gajov need everything on list. Everything.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا! قاجوف يحتاج كل شيء في القائمة. كل شيء.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|1BDF45864B621E0394066493FB596893", "source_en": "Have material?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "معك مواد؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|1CF38F29410DB803546949BAE8863729", "source_en": "Okay.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "حسناً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|1EB24AE54E3C099AA6377C8E5E7EE124", "source_en": "Good toy.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لعبة جيدة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|1ED257DF4F64F38782B062AE5C5956B0", "source_en": "Gajov want more material, more forge.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يريد مواد أكثر، حدادة أكثر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|1F56C7F04EBBEFD2190340B65F2FFD0A", "source_en": "Please, help Gajov fix.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أرجوك، ساعد قاجوف يصلح.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|1F73205D487020E71058BCBBF141E92E", "source_en": "(growl)", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "(زمجرة)", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2025450A4CDB75D6F7C1748093323F05", "source_en": "For hurting.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "للأذى.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2046998D45F248ED3C0C6988CA9A59F6", "source_en": "Now go.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "الآن اذهب.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|208321134081A0261064E0A71450C899", "source_en": "Yes. Yes! Gajov like Hellgrowth. Here see what Gajov made you! Hahaha!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "نعم. نعم! قاجوف يحب النماء الجهنّمي. هنا انظر ماذا صنع قاجوف لك! ههههه!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|21A7DF624EE9AE8A2560F296B84D62BF", "source_en": "Here, take list. Good pup.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "خذ، خذ القائمة. جرو مطيع.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|21FA22E947125B9358DE8B83FBDD7A5A", "source_en": "Ahh, the pup returns for more.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "آه، الجرو يعود للمزيد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|22AA5B464C1C1218FF3D3AA2497C23A6", "source_en": "Gajov have idea for new toys.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف لديه أفكار لألعاب جديدة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|23D04DA749513AC6C665E686C444772F", "source_en": "Bring material.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "أحضر مواد.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|23E4719A481FD678B3F703881ACBDF78", "source_en": "Vodor... broken... Gajov fix.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "ڤودور... مكسورة... قاجوف يصلح.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2402081540CDEF57F05520B323056A85", "source_en": "Men speak too much, more works, more lies.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "رجال يتكلمون كثير، عمل أكثر، أكاذيب أكثر.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|247D7FC0459A36475E9A3287CCD33B3B", "source_en": "Blood!", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "دم!", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|248BDA2D4ADCBDA096E6C2B3F92C32B7", "source_en": "Hellgrowth interest Gajov. Turns flesh and bone into something... m a l e a b l e. Gajov has idea. You help Gajov forge another weapon yes?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "النماء الجهنّمي يهم قاجوف. يحول لحم وعظم لشيء... قابل للتشكيل. قاجوف عنده فكرة. أنت تساعد قاجوف يطرق سلاح آخر، نعم؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|25C1D7AA4A166A1AFD146B9D6A1545E2", "source_en": "(growl)", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "(زمجرة)", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|262B49AD4B82AF3A73A84AB0C7CBD8E0", "source_en": "Gajov owes Lady Vodor.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يدين للسيدة ڤودور.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2772E1AC4345F6C72C0C8FA3C9A52F82", "source_en": "(growls)", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "(زمجرة)", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|28566D714F47FF9101B2F2AA240EC6F8", "source_en": "Gajov liked that one.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف أعجب بتلك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2A0C9A7440632BD2189C35A1B576CD0F", "source_en": "Gajov has waited so long.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف انتظر طويلاً.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2A5A7ACA453509FBBC7432A02A2F0745", "source_en": "Fire speak to Gajov. Gajov listen.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "النار تتحدث لقاجوف. قاجوف يسمع.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2BC1D42E4FD71619857016A68695CE53", "source_en": "Friend?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "صديق؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2BF138864B427532393A4DA0C0C261D7", "source_en": "Hmm.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "همم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2DE2DF08447E46581A3C8B89AC610292", "source_en": "Gajov no like waiting.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف لا يحب الانتظار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|2EFA09C840BF466F4227DABDE54F96D7", "source_en": "Nah-uh.", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "لا.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
{"id": "Verbals/VC_VerbalsNPC_Blacksmith|320F8A2B4D784370E8DF99B759D173A8", "source_en": "Gajov working. What now?", "category": "dialogue", "speaker": "NPC_Blacksmith", "ar": "قاجوف يعمل. ماذا الآن؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 4}}
